[00:41.066]Long may we fall

[00:47.438]In the light of it all

[00:55.646]This trembling hope

[01:02.144]To become something more

[01:13.062]As I gaze

[01:16.492]To the sky

[01:21.334]Stars fall like tears of heaven from my eyes

[01:27.445]In my heart

[01:31.231]I feel my home

[01:35.725]That place I've seen in dreams, but never been before

[01:48.390]Long may we fall

[01:54.262]In the light of it all

[02:02.093]This trembling hope

[02:08.382]To become something more

[02:16.021]Eternal in a soft bloom

[02:19.590]These petals float

[02:23.339]Atop an ocean of love

[02:30.621]Swimming through a holy soil

[02:34.514]Our hearts will ache this song

[02:41.614]Into the beyond

[02:49.011]As I gaze

[02:52.252]To the sky

[02:57.301]Stars fall like tears of heaven from my eyes

[03:03.477]In my heart

[03:07.334]I feel my home

[03:11.725]That place I've seen in dreams, but never been before

[03:22.150]As I blaze

[03:25.619]Through the light

[03:30.581]Stars erupt and planets blossom from the night

[03:37.164]My heart

[03:40.724]Screams for home

[03:45.136]Though I might never make it

[03:48.350]I will brave that void

[04:31.054]Sometimes I wonder if you dreamed me into existence.

[04:36.620]On your knees, crying like the cello cries;

[04:41.614]In tongues of men, in tongues of angels,

[04:45.829]Sinking through the fathomless,

[04:48.900]Singing the name I had before I was born.

[04:54.519]The world holds its breath.

[04:58.131]Take me with you.

[05:00.845]Like fiery contrails in the night sky,

[05:05.182]To the furthest reaches of Elysium we go.